":2,"html":"Key Benefits"},{"t":"ul","items":["Ultra-compact 21 × 17.8 mm design","Arduino-compatible development","Edge AI &amp; TinyML support","Multiple MCU platforms","Wi-Fi &amp; Bluetooth options","Extensive Grove ecosystem","Fast prototyping","Industrial and commercial deployment"],"ordered":false},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"XIAO Development Boards"},{"t":"p","html":"The XIAO Series includes a wide range of development boards designed for different embedded applications, allowing developers to select the ideal platform based on processing power, connectivity, and AI requirements."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"APPLICATIONS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Ideal For"},{"t":"icon","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 3.725 3.725\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 512 512\" xml:space=\"preserve\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><g><g fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"nonzero\" d=\"M.284.595h3.158a.113.113 0 0 1 .114.114v2.308q-.001.048-.034.08a.11.11 0 0 1-.08.034H.284a.113.113 0 0 1-.114-.114V.709Q.172.66.203.629V.627a.11.11 0 0 1 .08-.033m3.103.168H.338v2.2h3.05z\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\"1\" data-original=\"#000000\"></path><path d=\"M.266 1.066h3.205v.167H.266z\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\"1\" data-original=\"#000000\"></path><circle cx=\".592\" cy=\".918\" r=\".085\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\"1\" data-original=\"#000000\"></circle><circle cx=\".862\" cy=\".918\" r=\".085\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\"1\" data-original=\"#000000\"></circle><circle cx=\"1.132\" cy=\".918\" r=\".085\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\"1\" data-original=\"#000000\"></circle><path d=\"m.803 2.03.39-.39a.084.084 0 0 1 .117 0 .084.084 0 0 1 0 .118l-.39.39a.084.084 0 0 1-.117 0 .084.084 0 0 1 0-.118\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\"1\" data-original=\"#000000\"></path><path d=\"m1.192 2.537-.39-.39a.084.084 0 0 1 0-.117.084.084 0 0 1 .119 0l.